# This repository is a distributable agent framework: the Claude Code (.claude/)
# and Cursor (.cursor/) artifacts are part of what people copy, so they MUST be
# tracked. This overrides the user's global gitignore (~/.gitignore: *claude*,
# .cursor/) for this repo only.
#
# Source of truth is .github/agents/*.agent.md. The derived .claude/agents and
# .cursor/rules are generated by scripts/install.sh — regenerate them after
# editing an agent rather than hand-editing.
!.claude/
!.claude/**
!.cursor/
!.cursor/**
